.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt bastille-vlan 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm bastille vlan
.Nd Manage vlans for jail interface(s).
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm bastille vlan Oo Fl antu Oc Ar TARGET Sy add Ar VLAN INTERFACE Op IP
.Nm bastille vlan Oo Fl atu Oc Ar TARGET Sy remove Ar VLAN INTERFACE
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm bastille vlan
sub-command can add and remove vlans for targeted jails.
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy bastille vlan Oo Fl antu Oc Ar TARGET Sy add Ar VLAN INTERFACE Op IP
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a , Fl -auto
Auto mode. Start/stop jail(s) if required.
.It Fl n , Fl -no-ip
Add VLAN withouth an IP.
.It Fl t , Fl -tagged
Add/remove a tagged VLAN (bridge interface only).
.It Fl u , Fl -untagged
Add/remove an untagged VLAN (bridge interface only).
.El
.Pp
The
.Ar IP
must be supplied unless using the
.Oo Fl n , -no-ip Oc
flag.
.El
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Sy bastille vlan Oo Fl atu Oc Ar TARGET Sy remove Ar VLAN INTERFACE
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl a , Fl -auto
Auto mode. Start/stop jail(s) if required.
.It Fl t , Fl -tagged
Add/remove a tagged VLAN (bridge interface only).
.It Fl u , Fl -untagged
Add/remove an untagged VLAN (bridge interface only).
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Add VLAN 50 to myjail (auto mode):
.Sy bastille vlan --auto myjail add 50 vtnet0 10.10.10.10
.It Add VLAN 60 to myjail (auto mode,tagged):
.Sy bastille vlan --auto --tagged myjail add 50 bridge0 10.10.10.10
.It Remove VLAN 50 from myjail (auto mode,tagged):
.Sy bastille vlan --auto --tagged myjail remove 50 vtnet0
